<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA C.BANK REFINANCING FLAT AT 59.2 BLN LEVS.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA C.BANK REFINANCING FLAT AT 59.2 BLN LEVS.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgarian National Bank's (BNB)</p>
<p>refinancing to commercial banks stood at 59.186 billion levs on</p>
<p>December 6, unchanged from November 29, BNB preliminary figures</p>
<p>showed.</p>
<p>  BNB refinancing, mln levs	DEC 6    NOV 29     NOV 1</p>
<p>  Uncollaterlised deposits	 8,616     8,616     8,616</p>
<p>  Lombard loans			3,000     3,000     5,858</p>
<p>  Discount loans			   0	   0	   0</p>
<p>  Overdraft				107	 107	 107</p>
<p>  Overdue loans and deposits    47,463    47,463    47,463</p>
<p>  Total loans and deposits	59,186    59,186    62,044</p>
<p>  BNB treasury porfolio	  110,018   117,093    80,337</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
